              "name": "3BadBoxers"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I halved this recipe so I would only eat all 1-1/2 dozen of them instead of 3 dozen! The taste was great, my consistency was too moist, I should have cooked another minute or just cut out the water completely. Will make again though, and appreciate the somewhat healthy indulgence!"
